    "title": "Why Does This St. Paul Building Divide Opinions On Its Look? - NewsBreak",
    "text": "St Paul\nWhy Does This St. Paul Building Divide Opinions On Its Look?\nBy Paul Shea,\n2 hours agoGrowing up in the Twin Cities, I was driven by this building numerous times. I was always curious about its construction, as the highlight was the tile. Several past public surveys have deemed this building as ugly, but I'm not so sure; to me, it's more of a conversational piece. But I'm asking you: is this one of Minnesota's ugliest buildings?",
